Package: com.parv.octopusbridge
Name: OctopusBridge
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Draft bridge between ptpd's PTP responder and the Octopus app. Not ready to install.
 Would inject into ptpd on iOS 17 and register Octopus as a second PTP storage. It checks
 ptpd's UUID before hooking and does nothing on an unrecognised build. Octopus itself is
 a TrollStore app, not a package, so it is not listed as a dependency.
Maintainer: Parv Tahiliani <pat113@pitt.edu>
Section: Tweaks
